{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/703896ce87e9acb514c669067278cddc.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tulip Season is a cozy farming sim, where you help Willemijn grow the most beautiful tulip field in the kingdom. Time the blooms, breed new colors, upgrade the field, chat with the villagers. Play actively or let the farm run idle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/d62b9092b14aab6471c594dd89a1bc08.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0<strong>One crop, real depth.</strong> 15 tulip types, 50+ color-flower combinations, breeding, and field patterns. There's a lot to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover in a single flower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0<strong>Bloom timing as a mechanic.</strong> Synchronizing growth cycles across different tulip types adds a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gentle puzzle layer to the farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0<strong>Idle mode built in.</strong> Designed from the start to work both as an active game and a hands-off idle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0<strong>Gradual complexity.</strong> A progression tree introduces new tulip types, tools, and mechanics step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by step, keeping things cozy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37\u00a0<strong>Villagers with personality.</strong>\u00a0Characters visit your farm regularly, each with their own stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that unfold as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf37<strong>No stress.</strong> No timers, no fail states. Even the cow is more funny than punishing.Relaxing gameplay with optional idle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/2367643125359d9653471abad757432b.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant bulbs, water them, and help them flourish into colorful tulips. Each flower type has its own rhythm. Some bloom fast, others take many days. Synchronizing their cycles is key to creating beautiful patterns on your field and increasing its beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/27c1d795c7ce194f0422ed89fd964ddc.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/a945c0e83f10c47abd82e6abf9268807.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new tulip types as your farm develops. Breed flowers to reveal fresh color mixes and rare double blooms that add depth and beauty to your designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/7c59251da80b9209e8aaea2fe132244d.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/95b71292de325f65aa3e23fca448cdf2.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1140 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check in to plan your next pattern, or step away and let your tulips grow on their own. Your field keeps evolving even while you\u2019re not playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/cc65495c6c523d41c40586e457286f7c.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1266 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with visitors who stop by your farm and learn their stories. Completing small favors for them can bring rewards, new opportunities, and a few friendly smiles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/extras/a82f9b07003b13bcf62061776b0f57b4.avif?t=1774021319\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1774021319","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067890?t=1774021319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/f5c9b842e724c275231ad01f75af625bc714d686/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774021319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067890/f5c9b842e724c275231ad01f75af625bc714d686/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774021319","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Fam